Safe linking formula:```c
#define PROTECT_PTR(pos, ptr) \
  ((__typeof (ptr)) ((((size_t) pos) >> 12) ^ ((size_t) ptr)))
#define REVEAL_PTR(pos, ptr) PROTECT_PTR(pos, ptr) // same formula, XOR is symmetric
